# Toolshop QA Rules

- Prefer Playwright `data-test` locators (`testIdAttribute: data-test`).
- Keep Page Object pattern under `UI/pageobjects` and API helpers under `API/utilities`.
- Cap automated cases: roughly 5–8 per UI and API tier; tag `@smoke` / `@regression`.
- Checkout: click Confirm (`finish`) twice for invoice generation; assert INV-*.
- Never commit secrets, bearer tokens, or real PII.
- Prefer unique synthetic emails from `testDataFactory`.
- Select in-stock products via API before UI purchase flows.
